{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e1885107f971fd5d365bcc18a1ca07e5.avif?t=1763828139\" width=748 height=293 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly</strong>\u00a0around and\u00a0<strong>explore</strong> the island at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> seeds to <strong>replant</strong> the forests.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/595a77d1d671ec87d2e0a076b307ba36.poster.avif?t=1763828139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/595a77d1d671ec87d2e0a076b307ba36.webm?t=1763828139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/595a77d1d671ec87d2e0a076b307ba36.mp4?t=1763828139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong> and <strong>make friends</strong> with the locals - they might help you with clues and directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There used to be ton of <strong>native flowers</strong> on the island. Are they all gone or just really well hidden?<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/747b023e6f6f0c9a3601c9e8cbab5b5d.poster.avif?t=1763828139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/747b023e6f6f0c9a3601c9e8cbab5b5d.webm?t=1763828139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/747b023e6f6f0c9a3601c9e8cbab5b5d.mp4?t=1763828139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hike</strong> up the hills and mountains to take in the view, and <strong>level up</strong>! Can you reach all the peaks?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>catch</strong> some worms for dinner while you\u2019re out and about!\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fed1bc2fcd4fc51564b6d553d151a775.poster.avif?t=1763828139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fed1bc2fcd4fc51564b6d553d151a775.webm?t=1763828139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fed1bc2fcd4fc51564b6d553d151a775.mp4?t=1763828139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575210?t=1763828139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/9c45cf0782bed13ca7c9e7b6033e804a0bf53f5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763828139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/0b69459b6390cca06cc13cc45f2be3148f1eed5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763828139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/0b69459b6390cca06cc13cc45f2be3148f1eed5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763828139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b